<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=57" title="View the profile of Givins">Givins</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 218<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://mark.scns.com/eq/givins.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Illuminating mobs since 2001<br />
								<br />
								<a href="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/about_me/1,,,00.html?Uin=5226347" target="_blank"><img src="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/online?icq=5226347&amp;img=5" alt="5226347" width="18" height="18" border="0" /></a>
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=57"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:ktadema@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16759#msg16759"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16759#msg16759">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2820 on:</b> May 02, 2005, 11:43:00 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">  Ya something hapened . as UoP was starting CoH, Two groups of IL set up, pulled trigger, and blew coirnav spaw for 12 hours.<br />Odly enough that put the respawn right in IL&#039;s raid time.</div><br />Between OA and UoP, we couldn&#039;t even get a shot at Coirnav.  Both OA and UoP knew damn well that we were waiting on Coirnav to get into Time, and neither guild offerred to let us have a chance at him.  If we didn&#039;t do anything, we&#039;d probably be waiting for a month to get into Time.  We had to do something.    <br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote"> Grats IL ..     you do it with class!!</div><br />As has been mentioned before, it&#039;s well known that UoP is not above such tactics.  All that cock blocking that you guys had done in the past came back on you.  It&#039;s karma.  In fact, I wouldn&#039;t be surprised that the reason IL was unable to get a chance at Coirnav at all was because you guys were doing the same thing to us, and we just didn&#039;t know it.  <br /><br />Oh well, I&#039;m just glad that we are out of that little log jam.  We were starting to wonder if we&#039;d ever get a chance to kill Coirnav.  Hopefully we&#039;ll never have to compete for the same mob ever again.  
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Klozz 70th level Warrior, Givins, 68th level Wizard
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
