								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16760#msg16760">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2821 on:</b> May 02, 2005, 11:52:47 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16759#msg16759">Quote from: Givins on May 02, 2005, 11:43:00 pm</a></div><div class="quote"><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">  Ya something hapened . as UoP was starting CoH, Two groups of IL set up, pulled trigger, and blew coirnav spaw for 12 hours.<br />Odly enough that put the respawn right in IL&#039;s raid time.</div><br />Between OA and UoP, we couldn&#039;t even get a shot at Coirnav.  Both OA and UoP knew damn well that we were waiting on Coirnav to get into Time, and neither guild offerred to let us have a chance at him.  If we didn&#039;t do anything, we&#039;d probably be waiting for a month to get into Time.  We had to do something.    <br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote"> Grats IL ..     you do it with class!!</div><br />As has been mentioned before, it&#039;s well known that UoP is not above such tactics.  All that cock blocking that you guys had done in the past came back on you.  It&#039;s karma.  In fact, I wouldn&#039;t be surprised that the reason IL was unable to get a chance at Coirnav at all was because you guys were doing the same thing to us, and we just didn&#039;t know it.  <br /><br />Oh well, I&#039;m just glad that we are out of that little log jam.  We were starting to wonder if we&#039;d ever get a chance to kill Coirnav.  Hopefully we&#039;ll never have to compete for the same mob ever again.  <br /></div><br />you have to fight for kills in this game you cant expect other guilds to step out of your way and give you free attempts at mobs.... we did coir again to flag the rest of our 40-50 members that did not get it the first time we were nto blocking you....
						</td>
					</tr>
