						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16762#msg16762"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16762#msg16762">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2823 on:</b> May 03, 2005, 12:00:44 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16759#msg16759">Quote from: Givins on May 02, 2005, 11:43:00 pm</a></div><div class="quote"><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">&nbsp; Ya something hapened . as UoP was starting CoH, Two groups of IL set up, pulled trigger, and blew coirnav spaw for 12 hours.<br />Odly enough that put the respawn right in IL&#039;s raid time.</div><br />Between OA and UoP, we couldn&#039;t even get a shot at Coirnav.&nbsp; Both OA and UoP knew damn well that we were waiting on Coirnav to get into Time, and neither guild offerred to let us have a chance at him.&nbsp; If we didn&#039;t do anything, we&#039;d probably be waiting for a month to get into Time.&nbsp; We had to do something.&nbsp; &nbsp; <br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote"> Grats IL ..&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;you do it with class!!</div><br />As has been mentioned before, it&#039;s well known that UoP is not above such tactics.&nbsp; All that cock blocking that you guys had done in the past came back on you.&nbsp; It&#039;s karma.&nbsp; In fact, I wouldn&#039;t be surprised that the reason IL was unable to get a chance at Coirnav at all was because you guys were doing the same thing to us, and we just didn&#039;t know it.&nbsp; <br /><br />Oh well, I&#039;m just glad that we are out of that little log jam.&nbsp; We were starting to wonder if we&#039;d ever get a chance to kill Coirnav.&nbsp; Hopefully we&#039;ll never have to compete for the same mob ever again.&nbsp; <br /></div><br />We haven&#039;t done a single Time raid yet. The reason for this is that we do not have enough yet flagged to do so. We&#039;ve been trying to catch Coir for a couple weeks now to do him again so we can move forward. UoP needed Coir just as much as IL did.<br /><br />And the UoP I joined and am currently in has not used this type of tactic at any time that I&#039;m aware of (maybe in the past and under different leadership, but whatever). Even still, as far as I know we&#039;ve been nothing but courteous and polite with IL, but then IL blocks on a trigger and suddenly we deserve it? Heh...ok. Just remember that when later on someone may do it to you. Personally though, I&#039;d have rather just not seen this type of thing happen.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
