	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg16763"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=57" title="View the profile of Givins">Givins</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 218<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://mark.scns.com/eq/givins.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Illuminating mobs since 2001<br />
								<br />
								<a href="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/about_me/1,,,00.html?Uin=5226347" target="_blank"><img src="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/online?icq=5226347&amp;img=5" alt="5226347" width="18" height="18" border="0" /></a>
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=57"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:ktadema@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16763#msg16763"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16763#msg16763">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2824 on:</b> May 03, 2005, 04:10:54 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">  We&#039;ve been trying to catch Coir for a couple weeks now to do him again so we can move forward. UoP needed Coir just as much as IL did </div><br />Bullshit.  You guys wiped on Coirnav last weekend. You guys have had a zillion chances, and apparently have blown all of them except one.  Coirnav isn&#039;t UoP&#039;s God Given Spawn.  <br /><br />Really the problem has been more that OA has suddenly decided to bypass Arbiter and Xegony and has gone after Coirnav like 5 out of the last 7 spawns.  It really has very little to do with either UoP or IL.  <br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote"> you have to fight for kills in this game you cant expect other guilds to step out of your way and give you free attempts at mobs </div><br />That quotation is from a UoP member, right?  Why is it that when other guilds complain about wanting a chance at Coirnav, you guys say crap like that, but when others do fight for a kill, you complain?  Fighting for kills is a 2 way street, UoP.  <br /><br />I want to emphasize that we attempted to play nice and wait out all of yall&#039;s attempts and backflags, but we got sick of waiting, as mostly OA wiped over and over and over.  It became apparent that neither guild was interested in giving us a shot at him.  Our guild has been chomping at the bit to get into Time for many weeks now.  So we took matters into our own hands.  If we hadn&#039;t, who knows how many more OA and UoP wipes we would have had to wait out before Coirnav was left unmolested for IL to attempt?  It would have been another month.  Sorry, we just aren&#039;t interested in waiting that long.  <br /><br />One more little factoid I would like to bring to light:  our officers contacted UoP officers about joining forces to kill Coirnav, but UoP refused.  UoP was also asked to allow IL to allow one of its members to come along on their recent Rathe Council kill, but was refused.  It would have been very simple to trade a few flags between the two guilds.  You guys could have gotten a few Coirnav flags, we could have gotten (one I believe) a flag for Rathe Council.  IL has never been a flag hog.   We have often allowed a few stragglers to come along on our raids just to pick up a flag.  It&#039;s simply not our fault that you guys have members that still need the flag.  It&#039;s UoP&#039;s.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Klozz 70th level Warrior, Givins, 68th level Wizard
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg16764"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=522" title="View the profile of Self Destruction">Self Destruction</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 105<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v425/Undead13/Sharingan.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								With Teeth<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=522"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16764#msg16764"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16764#msg16764">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2825 on:</b> May 03, 2005, 04:54:53 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16763#msg16763">Quote from: Givins on May 03, 2005, 04:10:54 am</a></div><div class="quote">Bullshit.&nbsp; You guys wiped on Coirnav last weekend. You guys have had a zillion chances, and apparently have blown all of them except one.&nbsp; Coirnav isn&#039;t UoP&#039;s God Given Spawn.<br /></div><br />Wow, you&#039;re not even trying to be civil, are you? I don&#039;t understand how you twisted what I said to make it sound like I was saying that Coir was for UoP only. I said nothing of the sort. We weren&#039;t even attempting Coir for some time after our first success. What I said was that UoP has been after Coir for a couple weeks now...as in, we&#039;d like to kill him again so that we can finish our flagging. IL&#039;s chomping at the bit to raid Time? I guess you think we&#039;re still trying to kill Coir because the event is fun?<br /><br />...it&#039;s our <i>fault</i> some members of our semi-casual guild don&#039;t have the Coir flag? If you say so. This is something we were trying to remedy however. And as far as flag sharing goes, that kind of policy is set by the officers. Personally, I don&#039;t see a problem allowing someone from a guild (who has beaten the event they are tagging for) to tag along for a flag, but that&#039;s not up to me. If the officers don&#039;t want to do this either due to the hassle of it or simply because they would prefer we do things on our own, I&#039;m not sure this is even a negative thing. It&#039;s not as though UoP members are being told to go hassle guilds for flags they&#039;re missing, but we won&#039;t let anyone come along in return. Anyway, I can&#039;t speak to the reasons for this as I&#039;m not an officer, nor do I speak for the guild in any way other than just to state my opinion.<br /><br />Also, that comment about waiting for us to wipe a few more times is classy too. You&#039;re some kind of gentlemen&#039;s gentleman. It&#039;s also pretty cool that you&#039;re trying to make us sound like the bad guys, when we&#039;ve done nothing intentionally to harm IL. Meanwhile a couple groups from IL are in fact the ones who killed the trigger to keep other guilds from doing the event. How&#039;s that work?<br /><br />I didn&#039;t have a problem at all with IL and I still don&#039;t. I think you guys are good people including the officers. (that I know of)&nbsp; I just think this one situation was a bit messed up and I&#039;ve tried to express that as civily as possible, but you&#039;ve apparently decided to belittle and degrade UoP and pass this off as everyone else&#039;s fault. Whatever suits you, I guess.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: May 03, 2005, 05:04:18 am by Self Destruction</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
