	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg16767"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=236" title="View the profile of Carsonn">Carsonn</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 127<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/demon1.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I&#039;m a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=236"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16767#msg16767"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16767#msg16767">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2827 on:</b> May 03, 2005, 05:57:00 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							UoP leadship has been known to Cock Block on many things.  About Half of your leaders have been a party to that stuff and thats fine  but don&#039;t cry about it when it happens to you.<br /><br />As far as OA is conserned we have only attempted Coirnav 3 times so I have no idea where you get this 5 out of 7 times crap from.  Also who says OA has to do FR then xegony then coirnav then TRC ?  If we want to do TRC first then what ever the hell we want to thats our choice.  There is no rule that says you have to do any flag mob in order for pop progression.  We can kill RZTW first then Mith Marr if we wanted to that doesn&#039;t mean we are going to but we can.  Granted you can&#039;t go to diffrent zones untill you do teir 1 but there is no set way to do things and there isn&#039;t an order in what you have to do.  Don&#039;t get bitter at OA becuase we are trying to do mobs that you want.  Personally you can take this straw I have here and suck it up and stop whining about not getting a chance and be damn happy you finally made it to time.  Lord knows you talked all that crap about being better then UoP only to get smoked by them and DN to time.  
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
