								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16770#msg16770">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2829 on:</b> May 03, 2005, 07:32:35 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							You guys know, if you are all trying to get Cornaiv, alot of this stupid wrangling can be avoided if your guild leaders talk a bit, and just decide who gets it when.<br /><br />We did that in FoT with Conviction when they were attempting Cornaiv to get into Time, it was simple, send tell to Dissonant, ask what he thought of the idea, he says cool, we set the order, and go from there. No pissing matches, and was relatively quiet around here.<br /><br />Sad thing was, there were several elements in FoT that wanted to block them etc... and I simply saw no good reason for it. All it does is cause drama... hmm.... look familiar?
						</td>
					</tr>
