							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16767#msg16767">Quote from: Carsonn on May 03, 2005, 05:57:00 am</a></div><div class="quote">UoP leadship has been known to Cock Block on many things.  About Half of your leaders have been a party to that stuff and thats fine  but don&#039;t cry about it when it happens to you.<br /></div><br />Examples please?<br /><br />Quote:<br />We haven&#039;t done a single Time raid yet. The reason for this is that we do not have enough yet flagged to do so. We&#039;ve been trying to catch Coir for a couple weeks now to do him again so we can move forward.<br /><br />Maybe you should raid earlier, instead of resorting to 12 people blocking a spawn so you can catch it on your raid time, when you knew damn well that guild was CoHing to attempt at the same time your 12 people were.<br /><br />Didn&#039;t we have a rule at some point that if you have the numbers in the zone you can attempt a mob? I know this has happened several times between UoP and other guilds.&nbsp; It adds pressure, but it doesnt result in blown spawns.<br /><br />
