								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							&lt;sigh&gt; this doesnt appear to be going to get better as we get merged with Quellious. Not only do we have the three guilds here that are cat scratching.. there will be others on Quellious. I hope this all clears out before LoS Gets to that point in their flagging process. I hate squabbling over targets!! But gratz IL on taking down Cornaiv.. and gratz to both OA and UoP on getting Time Flagged in the recent months. I hope all of yall get the rest of your guilds flagged!!&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cool.gif" alt="Cool" border="0" />
